---
// src/components/bangalore/WhatWeFind.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-50 w-full border-y border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        What we usually find
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">
        None of these is big on its own. That is why they go unnoticed for months.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Finding 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">An offer that ran longer than you approved</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium mb-3">
            One Bangalore restaurant approved a Buy One Get One for 15 days. It ran for 30.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 inline-block border border-slate-200">
            They paid for all 30. They got it back only because somebody checked.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Finding 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Penalties nobody claimed back</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
            Complaints and late deliveries get charged to you. Almost nobody checks them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Finding 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Discounts you never agreed to fund</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
            Sale and festival offers get applied to your menu. Your share comes out of your payment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Finding 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Orders that never got paid</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
            The order went out. The money never came in. One missing order inside one weekly number is very hard to spot.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
